@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@keycloak = {{gateway}}/identity/realms/ticketing/protocol/openid-connect/token
@token = paste-access-token-here
@eventId = paste-event-id-here
@tierId = paste-tier-id-here

### Obtain a token (copy access_token into @token)
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=ticketing-cli&grant_type=password&username=admin&password=Demo123%21

### List events
GET {{gateway}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create event
POST {{gateway}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

{
  "name": "Architecture Summit",
  "description": "A local event-driven architecture demonstration.",
  "venue": "Grand Hall",
  "startsAtUtc": "2027-08-15T18:30:00Z",
  "totalCapacity": 100,
  "pricingTiers": [
    { "name": "General Admission", "price": 75.00, "capacity": 80 },
    { "name": "VIP", "price": 150.00, "capacity": 20 }
  ]
}

### Availability (allow a moment for EventCreatedV1 projection)
GET {{gateway}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remaining inventory for all events (used by the catalog UI)
GET {{gateway}}/api/events/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Purchase
POST {{gateway}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pricingTierId": "{{tierId}}",
  "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Sales summary
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/events/{{eventId}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
